--- stdout
Comparing old/specs/*.yml → specs/*.yml

~ specs/api.yml  Test 1

~   GET /pets  listPets  [breaking]
+     Request
+       Query parameters
+         limit  integer  required  [breaking: required query parameter added (client sends)]
      Responses
        200  OK

Endpoints: 1 changed with breaking changes, 0 changed compatibly, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged.
Result: breaking changes found.
--- stderr
"
`;

exports[`file selection and pairing > two single files pair even when their names differ 1`] = `
"exit code: 1
--- stdout
Comparing v1.yml → v2.yml

~ v2.yml  Test 1

~   GET /pets  listPets  [breaking]
+     Request
+       Query parameters
+         limit  integer  required  [breaking: required query parameter added (client sends)]
      Responses
        200  OK

Endpoints: 1 changed with breaking changes, 0 changed compatibly, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged.
Result: breaking changes found.
--- stderr
"
`;

exports[`output > a large endpoint shows only the shortest paths to its changes 1`] = `
"      Responses
        200  OK
          application/json  Order
            customer  Customer
              address  Address
-               zip  string  [breaking: property removed]
                … 2 unchanged, not shown
              … 2 unchanged, not shown
            seller  Customer (shown above)
            … 3 unchanged, not shown

Endpoints: 1 changed with breaking changes, 0 changed compatibly, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged.
Result: breaking changes found.
"
`;

exports[`output > an unchanged document with warnings still shows its warnings 1`] = `
"exit code: 0
--- stdout
Comparing old.yml → new.yml

  new.yml  Test 1
    warning: Unresolved $ref "missing.yml" in new.yml (missing.yml: file not found)
    warning: base: Unresolved $ref "missing.yml" in old.yml (missing.yml: file not found)

Endpoints: 0 changed with breaking changes, 0 changed compatibly, 0 added, 0 removed, 1 unchanged.
Run with --all to show the unchanged endpoints.
Result: no breaking changes.
--- stderr
"
`;

exports[`output > explode: false and default: false show as badges 1`] = `
"exit code: 0
--- stdout
Comparing old.yml → new.yml

~ new.yml  Test 1

~   GET /a  [changed]
      Request
        Query parameters
          ids  array[string]  explode: false
          all  boolean  default: false
+         x  any

Endpoints: 0 changed with breaking changes, 1 changed compatibly, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged.
Result: no breaking changes.
--- stderr
"
`;

